<title>CANADA: Southam Inc sets up special committee.</title>
<headline>Southam Inc sets up special committee.</headline>
<dateline>TORONTO 1996-11-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Southam Inc said on Wednesday its board has set up a special committee of directors independent of Hollinger Inc to consider Hollinger's offer to buy seven million Southam shares.</p>
<p>The committee will be chaired by Donna Soble Kaufman and will include Walter Bowen, Derek Burney, Yves Fortier and Stephen Jarislowsky.</p>
<p>RBC Dominion Securities Inc will act as the committee's financial adviser and Davies, Ward &amp; Beck as its legal adviser, Southam said.</p>
<p>-- Reuters Toronto Bureau (416) 941-8100</p>
</text>
